Package: openalexImportZenodo
Title: Import Zenodo Deposits as an OpenAlex Corpus
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Rainer M.", "Krug", , "Rainer.Krug@sib.swiss", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7490-0066"))
Description: Downloads the records of Zenodo communities, Zenodo searches or lists of
    Zenodo records into a project folder, keeps them up to date without downloading
    everything again, and writes them as a works corpus in the OpenAlex schema for the
    openalexPro packages, together with a table of the links between deposits and other
    outputs taken from Zenodo's related identifiers. Uses Zenodo only.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexImportZenodo
BugReports: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexImportZenodo/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    arrow,
    DBI,
    dplyr,
    duckdb,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    keyring,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
